      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "*Add CaCO3 (3 g) to V-8 juice (ca. 300 ml) and stir it for 2 h. After centrifuging, add seawater and agar to 200 ml of the supernatant. Adjust pH to 7.0."
